{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3973060/extras/4538ab9f5f903ce6b7c50e84f68c0e82.avif?t=1772130937\" width=736 height=70 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3973060/extras/b71216febb058bccf26f68fac6842243.poster.avif?t=1772130937\" width=736 height=244 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3973060/extras/b71216febb058bccf26f68fac6842243.webm?t=1772130937\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3973060/extras/b71216febb058bccf26f68fac6842243.mp4?t=1772130937\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You awaken with no memory and no purpose \u2014 only a final directive left behind by a dead world:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Finish the war.</strong><br><strong>End Nexis.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are the last surviving war machine of an extinct species, rebooted to destroy the quantum AI that seized Earth and erased all life.<br>There will be no rescue.<br>There will be no rebuilding.<br>Only termination.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3973060/extras/5a4432ecadeb8b91139b3c286af20aaf.avif?t=1772130937\" width=736 height=70 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3973060/extras/87c18a121889abfeb7ec93b016313240.poster.avif?t=1772130937\" width=734 height=268 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3973060/extras/87c18a121889abfeb7ec93b016313240.webm?t=1772130937\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3973060/extras/87c18a121889abfeb7ec93b016313240.mp4?t=1772130937\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You dismantle the <strong>Nexis</strong> network through <strong>six hostile industrial zones</strong>: <strong>military bunkers</strong>, <strong>chemical refineries</strong>, <strong>sewer systems</strong>, <strong>offshore platforms</strong>, <strong>dense server complexes</strong>, and an <strong>orbital facility</strong> above a lifeless planet. Each operation fractures another layer of the machine hierarchy, drawing you closer to the Nexis core \u2014 and to the realization that nothing remains to reclaim.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3973060/extras/c858ae6cbe0f746ec25c543bb5a3888d.avif?t=1772130937\" width=736 height=70 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3973060/extras/a2d5f6cf02666d76a35ae5585d8feaf4.poster.avif?t=1772130937\" width=734 height=268 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3973060/extras/a2d5f6cf02666d76a35ae5585d8feaf4.webm?t=1772130937\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3973060/extras/a2d5f6cf02666d76a35ae5585d8feaf4.mp4?t=1772130937\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Combat is <strong>precise, tactical, and unforgiving</strong>.<br>Every system in your chassis has purpose: energy routing, shield control, armament synergy, and movement efficiency.<br>Victory depends on timing, positioning, and disciplined power use \u2014 not spectacle alone.<br>Defeated bosses unlock new <strong>armaments</strong>, expanding your combat options and deepening the tactical layer as the campaign advances.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3973060/extras/af619d4327e50ed6faa9a41b5c095bbe.avif?t=1772130937\" width=736 height=70 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3973060/extras/7ee1c0ed327fa2aae5dcf06627a89959.poster.avif?t=1772130937\" width=734 height=268 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3973060/extras/7ee1c0ed327fa2aae5dcf06627a89959.webm?t=1772130937\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3973060/extras/7ee1c0ed327fa2aae5dcf06627a89959.mp4?t=1772130937\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face swarms of autonomous drones, entrenched turrets, advancing humanoid frames, elite combat units, lethal industrial hazards, and the <strong>Echoes of Nexis</strong> that overwhelm arenas with reinforcements.<br>Nine warforms stand between you and the core.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Every machine is active.</strong><br><strong>Every machine is hostile.</strong><br><strong>Every machine must fall.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3973060/extras/272d5f9c05a75f50b8b2ed83f37e966f.poster.avif?t=1772130937\" width=734 height=268 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3973060/extras/272d5f9c05a75f50b8b2ed83f37e966f.webm?t=1772130937\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3973060/extras/272d5f9c05a75f50b8b2ed83f37e966f.mp4?t=1772130937\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cold, mechanical atmosphere with focused tactical action</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>S</strong>ix hostile industrial environments</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Challenging bosses that unlock new armaments</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Precision combat built on timing, positioning, and energy control</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Integrated management of shields, power systems, and modular weapons</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Break the final defenses.</strong> <br><strong>Breach the orbital core.</strong> <br><strong>Shut down the last machine capable of ending you.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Sector Clearance I","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3973060/0c3e3be29d50f4659a46f8ef6baf013845d61e43.jpg"},{"name":"Sector Clearance II","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3973060/3c0b585d4868f4fb42cd3ea5d64ec76c9bd99b4e.jpg"},{"name":"Sector Clearance III","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3973060/5549f75b45eb19808234172ac40865f475aff679.jpg"},{"name":"Sector Clearance IV","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3973060/